meta {
  name: Create Measurement Session
  type: http
  seq: 4
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/measurement-sessions
  body: json
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Content-Type: application/json
}

body:json {
  {
    "productId": "{{productId}}",
    "heightCm": 178,
    "weightKg": 75,
    "chestCm": 96,
    "waistCm": 82,
    "hipsCm": 98,
    "recommendedSize": "L",
    "confidenceScore": 0.92
  }
}

docs {
  ## POST /api/measurement-sessions

  Records a measurement + sizing outcome session for analytics and history.
  Called by the widget after a successful recommendation to persist measurements.

  ### Body
  | Field           | Type   | Required | Description                             |
  |-----------------|--------|----------|-----------------------------------------|
  | productId       | string | ✅       | Product that was sized                  |
  | heightCm        | float  | ✅       | Customer height (cm)                    |
  | weightKg        | float  | ✅       | Customer weight (kg)                    |
  | chestCm         | float  | ✅       | Customer chest (cm)                     |
  | waistCm         | float  | ✅       | Customer waist (cm)                     |
  | hipsCm          | float  | ✅       | Customer hips (cm)                      |
  | recommendedSize | string | ❌       | The size that was recommended           |
  | confidenceScore | float  | ❌       | Recommendation confidence (0.0–1.0)     |

  ### Success (201)
  ```json
  { "session": { "id": "...", "createdAt": "..." } }
  ```
}
